Card Script Data
----------------

The card behavior scripts used by this engine are NOT part of this project
and are NOT covered by the MIT License. They are fetched at setup/build time
from the Forge project:

    https://github.com/Card-Forge/forge

and are placed into the following directories:

    bin/resources/cardsfolder/
    bin/resources/tokenscripts/

These files are the work of the Forge project and its contributors, and are
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.0 (GPL-3.0). A copy
of the GPL-3.0 is available at:

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

If you redistribute this project together with the fetched card scripts, the
contents of the directories listed above remain subject to the GPL-3.0. The
engine itself reads these files as data at runtime; it does not incorporate
them, and it remains available under the MIT License.

Magic: The Gathering is a trademark of Wizards of the Coast LLC. This project
is unofficial fan content and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Wizards
of the Coast. Card names, card text, and game mechanics referenced by the
card scripts are the property of Wizards of the Coast.

